    "slug": "the-versatility-of-metal-structures",
    "title": "The Versatility of Metal Structures: More Than Just Carports",
    "excerpt": "The Versatility of Metal Structures: More Than Just Carports When people think of metal structures, the first thing that often comes to mind is carports—simple, sturdy shelters that protect vehicle…",
    "feature_image": "blog/194A3779-scaled.jpg",
    "published_at": "2024-10-09T16:40:33",
